This folder holds the files /k9debug writes (server/debugdump.lua).
It is git-tracked (via this placeholder) specifically so it already exists
on disk wherever this resource is deployed, in case SaveResourceFile does
not create an intermediate directory that is not already there -- see
server/debugdump.lua's own header, "FILE OUTPUT -- VERIFIED, NOT ASSUMED".
Safe to empty; nothing reads this file's own content.
